{"id":"u-64e83352-0330-466f-9c89-65b67d5d12fd","src":"community","title":"Zodd the Immortal Full-Body Program","author":"Pratham Vernekar","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/pHDuGp-zodd-the-immortal-full-body-program","desc":"This is a Full-Body Program used to gain strength and hypertrophy your muscles. This program wont be as good as a typical powerlifting program, however for muscle-building it will be leagues better.\n\nThis program is 3 times a week, that way you maximize protein synthesis and maximize gains. \n\nAll lifts are synergized on this program, meaning all supplemental isolation lifts + Tier 2 compound movements (OHP, Pulldowns) will feed into your main Tier movements AKA your Barbell Rows and Weighted Dips. \n\nFor this program it is crucial to maximize your outside the gym habits, you're going to these lengths of doing full-body/upper lower to maximize muscle gain yet you're gonna leave gains on the table by not maximizing other habits?\n\nThe best advice I can give for the above it to eat sufficient protein (1-1.2 g per lbs of bodyweight), eat all your essential nutrients, vitamins, and minerals and eat an assortment of foods. Maximize your sleep, 8-10 hours, preferably higher is better. Of course don't forget creatine as that is the ultimate supplement to be taking on this program and make sure you are at least in maintenance, or 100-200 calories above ideally when running this program.","level":["Intermediate"],"goals":["Muscle","Strength"],"equipment":["Full Gym"],"minutes":80,"joins":0,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-03-14T13:37:47.830Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Day 1","Day 2","Day 3"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"ATG Weighted Dips","sets":[{"r":12,"pct":65,"x":3}]},{"n":"Pull-Up (Weighted)","sets":[{"r":12,"pct":65,"x":3}]},{"n":"Chest Press (Machine)","sets":[{"lo":6,"hi":10,"rpe":10}]},{"n":"Chest Supported Row (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"lo":6,"hi":10,"rpe":10}]},{"n":"Cuff Lateral Raise (Cable)","sets":[{"lo":6,"hi":10,"rpe"